{"parentUuid": "82931e70-359f-4b26-a18d-26b5e9aaf54a", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/home/dev/shopcart-api", "sessionId": "2f6c0d1e-demo-4b7a-9c3e-rate-limiting", "version": "2.1.0", "gitBranch": "feat/rate-limit", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "b47dcebf-8518-4b4b-a093-cf6bad07091f", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T10:03:05Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Done \u2014 rate limiting is in and committed as `a41c9e2`.\n\n**What changed**\n- `src/limit.rs`: token bucket, 30 req/min for anonymous clients (burst 10), keyed by `x-api-key` or client IP.\n- `src/main.rs`: enforced as middleware on `/search` only; paying customers with a key get the higher tier.\n- `docs/adr/ADR-007-rate-limiting.md` records the in-process choice and its consequence (limits reset on restart).\n\nAll 14 tests pass. Rejected requests get `429` with a `Retry-After` header."}]}}
